ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">.</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학년별 수강신청 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(8.8.~11.) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">에 신청한 과목 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">삭제</span></u></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">변경</span></u></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">및 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신규추가</span></u></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">□ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">타학년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">타학과에 개설된 과목 수강신청은 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교과목코드 직접입력</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">하여 수강신청</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">-</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">강좌는 일부 강좌는 외국인 학생만 수강신청 가능 (<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">한국어2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">고급한국어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">2, 전자상거래&amp;E-Biz(-01분반), 경영조직론(-01분반), 국제마케팅(-01분반))</span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전공에 개설된 과목 중 강의시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">강의실 내역이 없는 강좌는 원격강좌임</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">□ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학기 개시후 수강변경 및 수강정정으로 인한 수업 결손을 최소화 하고자 전체학년 수강신청 전에 일부 과목은 수강정원 조정 및 분반 추가개설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개설폐지 등 교과목 개설 내역이 변경될 수 있으니 확인 후 수강신청에 참고하시기 바람</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">.</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개설교과목 조회 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학교홈페이지</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">금오인</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">-&gt;</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학사정보</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">-&gt;</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개설과목안내</span></u></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">원스톱서비스 학부 개설과목 조회</span></u></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">)</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">□ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">수강신청인원 초과 및 강의실 멀티미디어 장비유무 등의 사유로 강의실이 변경되는 강좌가 있을 수도 있으니 수업 전에 확인 필요함</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">□ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기타 수강신청에 대한 자세한 사항은 학사안내 공지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">“2017</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학년도 2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학기&nbsp;수강신청 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">” </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span>참조</span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">□ 수강과목 변경신청서는</font></span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\"><strong> 8월 30일부터</strong> 학과사무실로 제출바람</font></font></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#0055ff\">□ 수강신청기간 동안 본인의 아이디 및 비밀번호 관리를 철저히 하여 수강신청 시 불미한 경우가 없도록 주의하시기 바라며, 악의적인 의도로 타인의 아이디를 사용하여&nbsp;신청 또는 변경, 삭제를 하는 경우 엄중히 처벌할 예정임</font></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">붙임 1. 수강신청사이트 메뉴안내 1부.</font></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; L